\newlabel{fig:appendix_nyuv2_heatmap}{{9}{14}{NYUv2 performance heatmap across reported metrics. Darker cells indicate stronger relative performance after accounting for metric direction. BPGS concentrates its gains on depth and total loss, while Static and UWSO remain stronger on some other tasks}{figure.9}{}}
